# Never uploaded to Railway: the Envio indexer runs on its own, and local-chain
# state and builds stay on the machine that made them.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash, every one. Unanchored, `indexer/` matched
# `app/api/indexer/` as well, so the route that reads the indexer was never
# uploaded and answered 404 in production (the same trap .vercelignore
# describes for `contracts/`).
/indexer/
/.localnet/
/.next-local/
/.next/
/.next-quest/
# The Chainlink CRE workflow is built and run by the CRE CLI, not by the app.
/cre/
